sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant System as System Process
    participant Cache
    
    User->>+System: Request data
    System->>+Cache: Check cache
    
    critical Fetch from cache
        Cache-->>-System: Data found
    option Cache miss
        System->>System: Fetch from DB
        System->>Cache: Update cache
    end
    
    System-->>-User: Return data
    
    break Cache connection lost
        System->>+Cache: Reconnect
        Note right of Cache: Attempting recovery
    end
